{"ID":"20231010164020-21zmqwi","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f4ab","id":"20231010164020-21zmqwi","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231010164020-21zmqwi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231010194513-f45rl81\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231220175330-cim1qes\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"周易六壬","type":"doc","updated":"20231220174917"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231010194513-f45rl81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010194513-f45rl81"}},{"ID":"20231010181825-8xpti18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010181825-8xpti18","updated":"20231010181825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"先天八卦图；（乾兑离震巽坎艮坤），乾一兑二离三震四巽五坎六艮七坤八"}]},{"ID":"20231010181825-lg5j8qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010181825-lg5j8qq","updated":"20231010181825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 356px;","style":"width: 346px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010181624-ipr331i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 346px;\" parent-style=\"width: 356px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010181827-au81oc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010181827-au81oc4"}},{"ID":"20231010164020-lh1i5ol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010164020-lh1i5ol","updated":"20231010165051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"后天八卦九宫图"}]},{"ID":"20231010164849-nlo6jl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010164849-nlo6jl5","updated":"20231010165050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口诀：戴九履一，左三右七，二四为肩，六八为足，五十居中"}]},{"ID":"20231010164944-8z38yoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010164944-8z38yoz"}},{"ID":"20231010165041-oz39yda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010165041-oz39yda","updated":"20231010165041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 273px;","style":"width: 263px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010165041-zj4jepx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 263px;\" parent-style=\"width: 273px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016091716-dt95hr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091716-dt95hr6"}},{"ID":"20231016091800-6dc3h69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091800-6dc3h69","updated":"20231016091913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"河图口诀：天一生水，地六成之。地二生火，天七成之。天三生木，地八成之。地四生金，天九成之。天五生土，地十成之。"}]},{"ID":"20231016091942-8xot577","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091942-8xot577","updated":"20231016092244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231016091942-vxzwj97.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231016092244-db9j2jl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231016091718-f7mvv4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091718-f7mvv4l","updated":"20231016093309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"龙马献河图，神龟载洛书；河图为体，洛书为用；"}]},{"ID":"20231016091716-aofqjc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231016091716-aofqjc9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010181831-9k3ridx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010181831-9k3ridx","updated":"20231010182039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳宅住位"}]},{"ID":"20231010181832-idpphyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010181832-idpphyx"}},{"ID":"20231010181525-i3q5jdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010181525-i3q5jdn","updated":"20231010181924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010181924-kxu3gj2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 437px;\" parent-style=\"width: 447px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010164928-0plv59m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010164928-0plv59m","updated":"20231220154046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点1：假如东西画线将九宫分为两半，则住北边生儿子，住南边生女儿；"}]},{"ID":"20231010182238-g7d9umd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010182238-g7d9umd","updated":"20231220154128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点2：也有特殊情况，阳极生阴，主卧房在东北角，如床靠东边的墙，则生女儿，这是唯一的例外（阳极生阴）；"}]},{"ID":"20231220154336-gxy3wo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220154336-gxy3wo0","updated":"20231220154336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点3：如果是住在南半球，南北要更换，东西定位不变，即住南边生男孩，住北边生女儿；"}]},{"ID":"20231010183734-xdhy91m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010183734-xdhy91m","updated":"20231220154425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点4：如阳宅的位置，东宫、东南宫是空的，人都靠西边落住，那将男女不生，因为孤阴不生，独阳不长，全部是空的（即便人工受孕也会意外流产）；"}]},{"ID":"20231220154316-zprsi0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220154316-zprsi0x","updated":"20231220154316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231220154316-v02zizr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231220175345-b0i5qup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220175345-b0i5qup"}},{"ID":"20231220175345-cvhuw1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220175345-cvhuw1l","updated":"20231220175556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"要点：如有5个女儿，如何天地定位？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231220175410-3sw4sd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220175410-3sw4sd2","updated":"20231220175620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"前三个不变，按顺序补位，四女儿补长女位，五女儿补次女位，等其中一个结婚，则按顺序往前补重新定位，如大女儿结婚，二女儿成长女位，三女儿次女位，四女儿少女位，五女儿长女位；"}]},{"ID":"20231011141508-xad02tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011141508-xad02tc","updated":"20231220154334"}},{"ID":"20231010183658-xkyrs6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010183658-xkyrs6m"}},{"ID":"20231010165056-k0h2oqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010165056-k0h2oqe","updated":"20231010184930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十二地支五行图（子丑寅卯辰巳午未申酉戌亥）"}]},{"ID":"20231010191609-96p88dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010191609-96p88dd","updated":"20231010191609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010191609-ck84eqi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010184813-gjbkg5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010184813-gjbkg5e","updated":"20231010184813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010184813-tynlvq0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20231010191040-72fsq3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010191040-72fsq3d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010184602-9qkotwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010184602-9qkotwc"}},{"ID":"20231010164928-8qj0fb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010164928-8qj0fb4","updated":"20231010185320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十天干五行方位图（甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸）"}]},{"ID":"20231010185326-pi1r40b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010185326-pi1r40b","updated":"20231010185355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甲乙木；丙丁火；戊己土；庚辛金；壬癸水；"}]},{"ID":"20231010185241-678np44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010185241-678np44","updated":"20231010185241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 530px;","style":"width: 520px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010185241-mcxlxk1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 520px;\" parent-style=\"width: 530px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010185245-44pqnkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010185245-44pqnkh","updated":"20231023142803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"观气色，如发现人气色不对，将遇灾祸（一般看到气色不对灾祸一个两周之内就会应验）如何看时间？"}]},{"ID":"20231010192010-hdyv22z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010192010-hdyv22z","updated":"20231010192354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青黑色：灾祸，横祸或水灾"}]},{"ID":"20231010192010-le4fjtl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010192010-le4fjtl","updated":"20231010192010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红或黄：火灾"}]},{"ID":"20231010192010-v1cls76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010192010-v1cls76","updated":"20231010192010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白色：凶杀"}]},{"ID":"20231011091122-wcs48jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011091122-wcs48jo"}},{"ID":"20231011091123-7elc4kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011091123-7elc4kj","updated":"20231011091139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病的气色是持续存在的，灾的气色是恍惚间看到的；"}]},{"ID":"20231011091122-o2by3hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011091122-o2by3hq"}},{"ID":"20231010192009-ooz7kfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010192009-ooz7kfy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如下："}]},{"ID":"20231010185840-3p70a1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010185840-3p70a1m","updated":"20231220164359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如观气色看到如火光的鲜红，过一下就看不到了，（如是持续的红则是心脏有问题，瞬发的则是灾祸将至），说明将遇火灾；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"按照五行生克，由水克火，这时可以查黄历，查近期天干中的壬或奎日（天干中壬奎都属水），再加上地支中的亥或子，就能判断是日期"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20231010191929-09rwk6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010191929-09rwk6a","updated":"20231010192833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间怎么计算？（小六壬法，左手）"}]},{"ID":"20231010192611-v4egpji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010192611-v4egpji","updated":"20231010192631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"速记：小空大，流速赤"}]},{"ID":"20231010192608-91rcwq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010192608-91rcwq5","updated":"20231010192608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231010192608-3uk9fjo.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231010190018-284hpz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010190018-284hpz5","updated":"20231220165326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以大安‘起月’，假如上面算出了是3月12号出事（农历），从大安起顺时针先数3，算出了拇指停在‘速喜’，再而以速喜为起点，数12次，算出拇指停在‘留连’，然后再以留连为起点，以十二地支往后数，如留连是子，速喜是丑，赤口寅，小吉卯，空亡辰，停在‘空亡’，空亡代表灾祸，而所问之事是灾祸的结果，所以到空亡就是终点，也就是出事时间就是辰时即上午7点到9点；再往后数，第二轮到空亡的时间点是数到戌，即晚上的7点到9点；出事只会发生在这两个区间；"}]},{"ID":"20231010194022-gulmx84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010194022-gulmx84","updated":"20231010194033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"火灾怎么避？"}]},{"ID":"20231010194034-5g27jc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010194034-5g27jc1","updated":"20231010194428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由水克火，可以用水避，时辰将到之时，让他靠近水如坐在浴缸上，水盆里（天命将至，有时靠近水如被热水烫死，触电而亡，从某种意义来说也算是火灾）；想尽办法让他接近冷水，热水器关掉，做水盆上；"}]},{"ID":"20231010194517-o1nve0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010194517-o1nve0s","updated":"20231010195258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳宅也能避灾，比如出事人家中属二女儿，则可以住在北的位置，形成水火既济卦；如出事人家中属爸爸，则可以住东北角，形成天山遁卦，可以躲过此灾；"}]},{"ID":"20231010195527-n9v7zba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010195527-n9v7zba","updated":"20231011082703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拓展"}]},{"ID":"20231011082637-s6waz8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011082637-s6waz8q","updated":"20231011083208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231011083208-xr1gurj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20231010195258-ogm8qlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010195258-ogm8qlw","updated":"20231220171236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以从更改时间的角度避，（如十二地支五行图，可以看作360度方位，也相当于住位），如爸爸将犯火灾，水克火，水的方位在北，则睡觉的时候教朝北，如爸爸住在东北角，双脚就要朝北睡（北为水位）；如意外横祸发生在白天，意外横祸色为黑为水，由土克水，我们希望将之改到半夜，那时间点一般是选丑时（丑为土），称为丑时是一个开生门的地方，睡觉的时候脚朝着丑的方位睡，那灾祸就会转移到晚上，晚上睡觉时梦到意外车祸属于正常现象；"}]},{"ID":"20231010190058-3nm4waj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010190058-3nm4waj"}},{"ID":"20231010194017-bqgs3wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010194017-bqgs3wd"}},{"ID":"20231010194730-60ch681","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231010194730-60ch681","updated":"20231010195257"}},{"ID":"20231011082714-u8n5rq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011082714-u8n5rq5"}},{"ID":"20231011104152-iqgd0cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011104152-iqgd0cs","updated":"20231011104200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳宅例子："}]},{"ID":"20231011104149-3a4lns2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011104149-3a4lns2","updated":"20231011145340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231011145340-9h499fk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20231011104202-pze9w59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011104202-pze9w59"}},{"ID":"20231011104251-dwzedk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011104251-dwzedk7","updated":"20231011140904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该阳宅三代同堂，祖父母已经退休，可因为祖父母居乾位，形上是退休，神上没有退休，神还是住在乾位，即爸爸妈妈的位置，还是要管很多事情；所以爸爸妈妈在修理儿子时，儿子也就是孙子告状祖父母就修理他自己的儿子；形成这种状况，年老的父母安置的位置要注重，可以将之移动到东北角艮位，大女儿原本住艮位，这就会导致不结婚，则移动到东南角即巽位，而父母则移至西北角最好；"}]},{"ID":"20231011140912-pmg8bnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011140912-pmg8bnh"}},{"ID":"20231011140927-kfeesez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011140927-kfeesez","updated":"20231011141446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要点1：名跟位一致时，他的功名、考试、健康等一切都会变好；"}]},{"ID":"20231011141400-yqbbd83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011141400-yqbbd83","updated":"20231011141503"}},{"ID":"20231011141402-tawlvfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011141402-tawlvfb","updated":"20231011144619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"做医生坐位（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"开门的方向为外卦，坐位的方向为内卦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；做生意当老板也是一样的道理）"}]},{"ID":"20231011145141-o36bmp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011145141-o36bmp0","updated":"20231011145141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20231011145141-jhsc62g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20231011141400-82nsy5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011141400-82nsy5f"}},{"ID":"20231011144200-m7e9gy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011144200-m7e9gy8","updated":"20231220174420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如诊所开门朝西，则兑为泽，外卦就是泽卦，坐位坐在东位，就成泽雷随卦，如坐位在东南角，就成泽风大过卦，如坐位南，就成泽火革卦，如坐位西南，就成泽地萃卦，如坐位西北，就成泽天夬卦，调好的地方坐，如随卦；"}]},{"ID":"20231011141400-bo2ciyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011141400-bo2ciyx"}},{"ID":"20231011151115-6pnrcqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011151115-6pnrcqq","updated":"20231011151224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要点1：看阳宅，确定各方位位置要以房屋的中心点出发来天地定位；天地定位是以东南西北作正位；"}]},{"ID":"20231011151158-ubd5vvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231011151158-ubd5vvm"}},{"ID":"20231220174848-261v8ap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231220174848-261v8ap","updated":"20231220174917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"罗盘阳宅定位最好先在宅外定，因为宅内可能存在电子设备影响磁场；"}]},{"ID":"20231220175330-cim1qes","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20231220175330-cim1qes"}},{"ID":"20240911162830-6kvp00n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240911162830-6kvp00n"}}]}